  "an3.33:5.3": "The state of mind described here corresponds to the five-factored noble right concentration described in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.28'>AN 5:28</a>, and analyzed more fully in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an9.36'>AN 9:36</a>. For further discussion, see <a href='https://www.dhammatalks.org/books/Wings/Section0021.html'>Section III/F in <i>The Wings to Awakening</i></a> and the essays, <a href='https://www.dhammatalks.org/books/PurityOfHeart/Section0013.html'>“Jhāna Not by the Numbers”</a> and <a href='https://www.dhammatalks.org/books/Noble&True/Section0009.html'>“Silence Isn’t Mandatory.”</a>",
